{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達同意支付2.9億美元，以和解投資者於2018年提起的一項集體訴訟。訴狀指稱，英偉達隱瞞了其面向遊戲玩家銷售的顯卡所帶來的營收在多大程度上依賴加密貨幣礦工的需求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588174.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:03:54.230622+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:40:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:57:12.867603+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:57:12.867603+00:00","content_hash":"6a5b5384e4c731d1af9facbc9212fe29dc797bd534ddbe443c063921d3d15caf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}